=== PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end) ===
  - Data sources (web useSettings/useSaveSettings/useToast/useChartPalette/
    useStatusBarPrefs/useAchievementCelebrationPrefs/useSidebarStyle/useTranslation):
    bound through the P1/S8 seam AppearanceSettingsSource→AppearanceSettingsModel. The
    prod source fires GET /settings, PUT /settings (web request(), full-replace merge)
    for ui_density/time_format_default/chart_palette; the four device-local prefs
    (status bar, celebration, sidebar style, theme) read/write localStorage-equivalent
    stores. No HTTP / no storage in the view.
  - Composition (web GlassPanel + IconBox + ThemePicker + Toggle + Button + HelpIcon
    + FadeIn + Toast), reproduced in web top-to-bottom order:
      • FadeIn/GlassPanel/IconBox -> TSFadeIn / TSGlassPanel / TSIconBox(paintpalette).
      • <ThemePicker showMode showCustom> -> composed AppearanceThemeSection:
        a System/Light/Dark display-mode card group + an accent-preset swatch row,
        routed through the model's theme seam. The rich multi-theme + custom-RGB
        picker stays the shared component-library atom (OUT OF SCOPE per the prompt);
        this feature view composes the mode + accent controls (documented drift, rule 9).
      • Density picker -> 3 choice cards (compact/comfortable/spacious) each with a
        density swatch + the LIVE reflowing preview (Preview title + the 3 "Sample row
        — Tesla Model 3/Y/S" rows whose height + padding track the selected density,
        the native equivalent of body[data-density]).
      • Sidebar style -> 3 choice cards (Minimal/Compact/Classic) each with a silhouette
        swatch (accent-bar / dotted-rows / icon-tiles), device-local + always interactive.
      • Default time format -> 2 choice cards (relative / absolute).
      • Chart palette -> 2 choice cards (cb_safe / neon) each with the full 8-swatch row,
        swatch hexes BYTE-IDENTICAL to web lib/colors.ts (CHART_COLORS_CB_SAFE /
        CHART_COLORS_NEON), asserted in the test suite.
      • Status bar -> panel with "Show status bar" (+ shown/hidden info toast) and
        "Always icon-only" (dims when the bar is hidden) toggle rows.
      • Celebration -> panel with showToasts / playSound / showOnDashboard / pushOnUnlock
        toggle rows.
      • Product tours -> panel with Replay-dashboard / Debugger / Automations tour
        buttons + a danger "Reset all tours" button (+ success toast).
